    34	
    35	This section is the one home of the formats below. Every other mention cites it.
    36	
    37	### `literature-corpus/1`
    38	
    39	- **`model`, `model_sha256`:** the model file and its digest.
    40	- **`artifacts`:** the `gnd extract` bundle path, plus the digests of its
    41	  applicable set and projection.
    42	- **`documents[]`:** each document's `id`, `path` and `sha256`.
